Hello All,

Philmac 3G (which includes all versions) and UTC products are not recommend=
ed or warranted for use inside buildings or on hot water lines per Philmac.

These products are intended for use in pipes outside and typically buried.

Justin will mount a cautionary note to this effect on the website and updat=
ed price sheets will carry the same note.

John

